1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See [in French]: https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacques-Henri_Dreyfuss
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi in Sedan -   1873-1880 Chief Rabbi of Belgium- 1880-1891 Chief Rabbi of Paris-- 1891-1933.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jacques-Henri DREYFUSS Born in Schirrhofen (Bas-Rhin) in 1844 and died in Paris in 1933. Leaving the Jewish Seminary in Paris in 1868, he became rabbi in Sedan. He succeeded Zadoc Kahn in 1891 to the Chief Rabbinate of Paris, a p
2 CONC osition he held until his death in 1933. He published several series of sermons.
2 CONT
2 CONT His nephew, Julien Weill, succeded him as Chief Rabbi of Paris.
