1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Il essaya de maintenir la communauté durant la Révolution. Il avait fait des études rabbiniques et perdit la fortune familiale, dilapidée en assignats.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mayer Netter (1730-1805), son of Lehmann, experienced the Revolution and the ruin of the family. He tried to maintain the community during these difficult years. He had done extensive rabbinical studies. Detached from material thi
2 CONC ngs, he did not succeed in regaining his ancestral fortune, which was left in assignats, but his conduct was exemplary in the face of the new ideas conveyed by the Revolution.
