1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Private funeral services have been held for Consuelo Bley Lilienthal, a member of a pioneer San Francisco family and widow of a longtime Examiner editor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Lilienthal died at her home on Oct. 24 after a short illness. She was 86.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her late husband, Josh Eppinger Jr., who died in 1979, was at The Examiner in various editorial and executive posts until his retirement in 1973.
2 CONT
2 CONT A native San Franciscan, Mrs. Lilienthal was preceded in death by Eppinger and two other husbands, Max Hofmann and Ernest Lilienthal.
2 CONT
