1 NAME Lehmann Leyman Isaac /Netter/
2 GIVN Lehmann Leyman Isaac
2 SURN Netter
2 _MARNM Netter
2 NICK Lehmann Itzig Netter
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Rosenwiller
3 STAE Alsace
3 CTRY France
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1709
