1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yves Oppert was born on May 25, 1909 in Paris,France. When growing up his mother died when he was only seven years old. Oppert was brought up by his grandfather; the Ashkenazi Grand Rabbi of Paris. He became a succ
2 CONC essful businessman; who served with the French forces in 1938-39 befor being captured. He escaped to Vichy-controlled France; and used his business contacts to supply the French Resistance. He also helped to hide Jewish children; 
2 CONC and to organize the escape of stranded Allied soldiers. He was captured, tortured and killed in 1944. His wife participated fully in his work and set up three orphanages for Jewish children orphaned during the war. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.ushmm.org/wlc/en/idcard.php?ModuleId=10006241 
2 CONT
