1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Independent Journal Saturday, November 29, 1975 Page 4
2 CONT
2 CONT MARTHA GERSTLE
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Graham Gerstle, widow of a member of a prominent San Rafael family, died yesterday at her home.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband, Dr. Mark L. Gerstle, who died in August, was the son of early San Rafael residents Lewis and Hannah Gerstle who gave the city Gerstle Park. He was a retired psychiatrist and author of several books.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Gerstle is survived by a son, Douglas Freelander of Houston, Tex.; a daughter, Joyce Sullivan of New Haven, Conn., and a sister, Mary Fritts of Brookside, N.Y.
2 CONT
2 CONT At Mrs. Gerstle’s request, there will be no funeral.
