2 CONT The list of R.M.S. Titanic 1st Class Passengers: "Léontine Pauline Aubart" has the profile for Fleurette Guggenheim (Seligman) installed. This profile has been published in error. Fleurette Guggenheim (Seligman) was Benjamin Gugge
2 CONC nheim's wife. Other than being listed as a Titanic Survivor, the profile  information should be correct.  The woman who accompanied him on the R.M.S. Titanic was   https://www.geni.com/people/Leontine/6000000071797787067?through=6
2 CONC 000000010425031367, his paramour, whose information below is essentially correct. On Benjamin's profile, she is listed as his partner. Fleurette is listed as his wife.  
