1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Edgar Isaac Seligman (14 April 1867 – 27 September 1958) was a British épée, foil, and sabre fencer. Seligman was born in San Francisco, California, United States to German parents. After the family moved to London he became a Br
2 CONC itish citizen by naturalisation.
2 CONT
2 CONT A talented artist by profession, Seligman competed in five Olympiads as a member of the British fencing team, and was the only man to win the British fencing championship in all three weapons twice.
2 CONT
2 CONT He fought in the Boer War as a Corporal in the Imperial Yeomanry, and his brother was Brigadier General Herbert Seligman."
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================================================
