2 CONT
2 CONT "the son of writer and rare-books dealer, George S. Hellman. Born in New York City, he was also the great-grandson of banking titan Joseph Seligman, and thus, by ancestry, part of the city's German-Jewish elite "
2 CONT
2 CONT "During World War II, Hellman was in Washington D.C. where he wrote for the Office of the Coordinator of Inter-American Affairs, the War Department and helped to write a top-secret history of the OSS."
2 CONT
2 CONT {ed note ~• which might make one  ponder [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000069494650016& ''the association''] with [http://www.geni.com/people/Archbold-van-Beuren/6000000019188128243 '''Archbold van Beuren'''], hi
2 CONC s first cousin's husband. A.vB. was a high ranking security for the OSS and later ran Cue Magazine in New  York. }<br/>
2 CONT '' musings of MMvB profile manager.''
2 CONT ~• they were at Yale together as well, though not in the same class
2 CONT
