1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MATZGER, Paul J. -- In Berkeley on Feb. 10th at 61 years of age. A native of San Francisco, he practiced law with Leland, Parachini, Steinberg, Matzger and Melnick in San Francisco. Survived by his wife Lucia; daug
2 CONC hter Helen (David Anderson) Matzger; son Edward A. Matzger; granddaughter Louisa; brother Alan D. Matzger and sister Jane (Donald J.) Kauffman; six nieces and one nephew. Memorial Service will be held on Wednesday, Feb. 14th at 10
2 CONC :30 AM at Cong. Emanuel in San Francisco. In lieu of flowers donations may be made to Cong. Emanuel or A Better Way of Berkeley, CA, or the New Israel Fund, or the Carmel Bach Festival. Arrangements by Sinai Memorial Chapel. http:
2 CONC //www.sfgate.com/news/article/MATZGER-Paul-J-2952693.php
