1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr. Adele Solomons Jaffa was a physician, lecturer in dietetics, and child psychiatrist. She worked towards improving diets in orphanages and perfecting therapeutic techniques for children with physical handicaps r
2 CONC elating to cerebral palsy, deafness, imperfect sight, and other losses. During World War I she helped Herbert Hoover in ration planning for Belgian war relief. 
2 CONT
