2 CONT Obituary:
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva Ullman, 94, Sarasota, died March 23, 2005. She was born Oct. 11, 1910, in Nurnberg, Germany, and came to Sarasota in 1977 from Boston. She volunteered at Meals on Wheels and Feel-I-Should- Help in Sarasota. Survivors include a
2 CONC  daughter, Alice Dustin of Ardmore, Pa.; a son, Charles of Paris, France; and two grandchildren. - See more at: http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/heraldtribune/obituary.aspx?page=lifestory&pid=86256829#sthash.of8RTR8M.dpuf
