2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT There are records related to Irma Bamberger at USHMM, Arolsen Institute, German Minority Census, Jewish.Gen (North Bavarian Jews, Aufbau), and Beit Hatfutset.  Irma emigrated from Kitzingen, Germany to Copenhagen in 1939; was depo
2 CONC rted from Copenhagen to Theresienstadt in 1944; and released/returned to Denmark via the "White Buses" operation near the end of WWII. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See two additional articles from Google search:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://samlinger.natmus.dk/FHM/asset/235794
2 CONT
2 CONT http://scandinavianjewish.blogspot.com/2016/07/georg-cohn-part-ii-under-german.html
