1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jacob Felsenthal''' married his first wife, Theresia Hertz, on 16 Jan 1834 in Odenbach, Germany. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Theresia Hertz was born 23 APR 1809 in Odenbach. She died 12 APR 1838 in Odenbach. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together Jacob and Theresia had 3 children:
2 CONT Herrmann Felsenthal 1834 – 1838
2 CONT Johannetta "Hannah" Felsenthal Strauss 1836–1902
2 CONT Still Born Baby Felsenthal 1838
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob married his second wife, Gertrude Hertz 22 Feb 1839 in Odenbach, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Together Jacob and Gertrude had 13 children:
2 CONT Emanuel Felsenthal 1839 – 1840
2 CONT Albert (Abraham) Felsenthal 1840 – 1909
2 CONT Marianna "Mary" Felsenthal Birkenstein 1841 – 1918
2 CONT Isaac (Isaak) Felsenthal 1842 – 1917
2 CONT Judith (Yetta) Felsenthal Ex 1845 – 1921
2 CONT Benjamin Felsenthal (1846 - 1922)
2 CONT Charlotha "Lena" Felsenthal Kaufmann 1847 – 1929
2 CONT Jakob Felsenthal 1848 – 1848
2 CONT Sara Felsenthal Baumflek 1849 – 1935
2 CONT Samuel Felsenthal 1851 – 1919
2 CONT Salomon "Solomon" Felsenthal 1853 – 1930
2 CONT Carl Felsenthal 1854 – 1855
2 CONT David J Felsenthal 1857 – 1924
2 CONT
2 CONT
