2 CONT ===Titanic Passenger Summary===
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Mr Benjamin Guggenheim
2 CONT Titanic Victim
2 CONT Born: Thursday 26th October 1865
2 CONT Age: 46 years 5 months and 20 days (Male)
2 CONT Nationality: American
2 CONT Religion: Jewish
2 CONT Last Residence: in Paris, France
2 CONT Occupation: Businessman
2 CONT 1st Class Passengers
2 CONT Embarked: Cherbourg on Wednesday 10th April 1912
2 CONT Ticket No. 17593, £79 4s 
2 CONT Cabin No. B-82
2 CONT Died in the Titanic disaster (15th April 1912)
2 CONT Body Not Identified
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''More at''' http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benjamin_Guggenheim
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Guggenheim (October 26, 1865-April 15, 1912) was an American businessman. He died aboard RMS Titanic when the ship sank near Cape Race, Newfoundland.
2 CONT
