1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles Samuel Myers, CBE, FRS (13 March 1873 – 12 October 1946) was an English physician who worked as a psychologist. '''''He wrote the first paper on shell shock†† in 1915''''', but did not invent the term. He w
2 CONC as co-founder of the British Psychological Society and the National Institute of Industrial Psychology.
