1 NOTE {geni:about_me} one of the family homes was at New Vernon, Morris Co., NJ, the Howard Bayne Farm. See (for instance) https://www.newspapers.com/image/220752895/?terms=%22Bayne%22%20%22New%20Vernon%22&match=1 The Courier-News
2 CONT 29 Aug 1921, Mon · Page 7
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT "Daphne van Beuren Bayne (1916–2002), a New Jersey banking heiress who became known as a jazz harpist under the name Daphne Hellman." (profile photo shows her with harp)
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.nytimes.com/2002/08/08/nyregion/daphne-hellman-harpist-with-eclectic-taste-dies-at-86.html '''New York Times obituary'''] (a must read)
2 CONT
2 CONT (another obit. which includes descendant info.:
2 CONT
2 CONT "SHIH-Daphne Bayne Hellman. Passed away peacefully on August 4, 2002, at age 86. Famed jazz harpist of Hellman's Angels. Beloved mother of Daisy Hellman Paradis, Digger St. John and the late Sandy Bull. Dear motherin-law of David 
2 CONC Paradis, Mona St. John and Candy Bull. Cherished grandmother of Sasha and Alain Paradis, and Davina-Nicole, BrittanyKara and Bayne-Alexander St. John, and Cassandra, Jesse and Jackson Bull."
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.newjerseyhills.com/daphne-bayne-hellman-harpist/article_e3e00772-2b5c-577f-a2e5-c383f4d52a00.html '''burial''']
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandy_Bull '''name appears in her son's wikipedia listing''']
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.spaceagepop.com/hellman.htm ''' 'Space Age Pop' bio ''']
2 CONT
2 CONT "Daphne Hellman, was a woman of considerable means; her family founded the Seaboard National Bank. But she dedicated her life to culture and music. An accomplished harpist, she achieved her own notoriety with eclectic performances
2 CONC  on the instrument, and in later life, took her harp to the New York subway, accompanied by the self-explanatory percussionist Mr Spoons. Hers was a long and colourful life (she died aged 86 in 2002), '''the subject of an intimate
2 CONC  short film by her granddaughter, K C'''."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://vimeo.com/15307068 ^ this is the video
