2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sali Bluemlein was born in Untereisenheim on 31 May, 1874, to Joseph Bluemlein and Klara Schloss. On her 26th birthday, 31 May, 1900, she married Raphael Wolfromm.  The couple moved to the Netherlands to avoid capture but Sali was
2 CONC  transported to Sobibor, where she perished on 30 Apr., 1943.
2 CONT
2 CONT Overledene: Sali Blümlein Geslacht: Vrouw Leeftijd: 68 Vader: NN Moeder: NN Relatie: Raphael Wolfromm Relatiesoort: Echtgenote Gebeurtenis: Overlijden Datum: vrijdag 30 april 1943 Gebeurtenisplaats: Sobibor (Polen)
