2 CONT Hanna (Hannchen) Bluemlein was born on 8 Jun., 1876, in Untereisenheim Bavaria, to Joseph Bluemlein and Klara Schloss.  Hanna and some of her siblings lived for a time in Schweinfurt and then emigrated to the Netherlands in an att
2 CONC empt to escape the Holocaust, but Hanna was transported to Sobibor, where she perished at an unknown date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Overledene: Hanna Blümlein Geslacht: Vrouw Leeftijd: 66 Vader: Josef Blümlein Moeder: Klara Schloss Gebeurtenis: Overlijden Datum: vrijdag 23 april 1943 Gebeurtenisplaats: Sobibor (Polen)
