2 CONT cf.: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liste_der_Stolpersteine_in_Gouda
2 CONT
2 CONT Babette Bluemlein was born on 4 Dec., 1882, in Untereisenheim, Bavaria, the ninth and last child of  Joseph Bluemlein and Klara Schloss.  On 10 Feb., 1907, she married Sigmund Oppenheimer of nearby Schweinfurt and they had one dau
2 CONC ghter. They family moved to The Hague, Netherlands, in an attempt to escape the Holocaust, but Beti and Sigmund were transported to Auschwitz, where Beti perished on 26 Oct, 1942. 
