2 CONT January 31, 1881 New York Times Current File Fatman-- Suddenly, of heart disease, on the 29th inst., Fannie, widow of the late Joseph Fatman, aged 63 years. Funeral takes place from No. 40 West 57th-st., Tuesday, Feb. 1, at 10 o'c
2 CONC lock A.M. It is requested that flowers be omitted.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Fatman and mother of, Isabella Ranger, Louisa Ranger, Solomon Joseph Fatman, Adeline Fatman, Rachel Ranger, Theresa Ranger, Sarah Fatman, William Fatman, Frederica Mary Rosenfeld, Charlotte Rothschild, Alfred Fatman
