1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.leo-bw.de/detail/-/Detail/details/PERSON/kgl_biographien/1012779068/Rosenberger+Adolf
2 CONT
2 CONT https://adolf-rosenberger.com/
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adolf_Rosenberger
2 CONT
2 CONT Race driver for Mercedes Benz - Founder of Porsche GmbH
2 CONT
2 CONT Despite Rosenberger's contribution to the development of German automobiles and German auto racing, when Hitler came to power in Germany, Rosenberger, a Jew, was arrested for "Rassenschande" (racial crimes), and imprisoned at KZ S
2 CONC chloss Kislau near Karlsruhe. He was released, by the goodwill of a colleague, Hans Baron Veyder Mahlberg who bribed Gestapo agents, but he was forced to leave Germany immediately. He emigrated to France, and later to Great Britai
2 CONC n, representing Porsche GmbH in both of those countries. He immigrated to the United States in 1939 and in 1944 he became a US-citizen under the name of Alan Arthur Robert. 
2 CONT https://www.lootedart.com/news.php?r=WF94GG849111
