2 NOTE Hi Adam, this is Merri, Nancy's daughter. I have studied the picture carefully and if you notice the man sitting on the floor in the very lower right hand corner? He's holding a cigar. Compared to the photo I uploaded called "Happ
3 CONC ier Times", I am almost certain that this man is my great grandfather Rudolph Marx. In my photos, he is rarely seen without his cigar. I hope that I am right. Freida is not among them. You do so much work on this site and it is gr
3 CONC eatly appreciated. I received the bulk of my grandfather's papers and photos, and I am in the process of scanning the really fragile ones first. 
