2 CONT     Histories of Two Hundred and Fifty-One Divisions of the German Army which Participated in the War (1914-1918), compiled from records of Intelligence section of the General Staff, American Expeditionary Forces, at General Headq
2 CONC uarters, Chaumont, France 1919 (1920)
