1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Samuel Isidore Salmon=
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samuel_Isidore_Salmon
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Samuel Isidore Salmon, Kt. CBE, JP, 18 October 1900 - 1980, was a politician, corporate executive, and philanthropist.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Isidore Salmon was the son of Isidore Salmon MP and Kate Abrahams. He attended Bedales School, for which he was head boy in 1919.
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1965 to 1968, he was a member of the Greater London Council, for which he became Deputy Chairman in 1968. He was Mayor of Hammersmith and Fulham in 1968/9, and from 1965 to 1968 was chairman of J. Lyons and Co..
2 CONT
2 CONT Salmon married Lallah Wendy Benjamin; they had two children: Belinda Harding and Johnathan Salmon.
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=151536031-5-500001&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-8651919f24d976e7caf5bc43cb453dd9&mrid=6d08d62bf4e7c1a09b399ab9ff417bee My
